\ Model ilp-pa_copy
\ LP format - for model browsing. Use MPS format to capture full model detail.
Maximize
 
Subject To
 sum_(x+f'{e}_{t}')_==_1[2]: x+f'{e}_{t}'[0,2] + x+f'{e}_{t}'[1,2]
   + x+f'{e}_{t}'[2,2] + x+f'{e}_{t}'[3,2] = 1
 z+f'{e}_{k}_{t+1}'_<=_x+f'{e}_{t+1}': - x+f'{e}_{t}'[2,2]
   + z+f'{e}_{k}_{t}'[2,0,2] <= 0
 z+f'{e}_{k}_{t+1}'_<=_x+f'{e}_{t+1}': - x+f'{e}_{t}'[1,2]
   + z+f'{e}_{k}_{t}'[1,1,2] <= 0
Bounds
 z+f'{e}_{k}_{t}'[1,1,2] >= 1
 z+f'{e}_{k}_{t}'[2,0,2] >= 1
Binaries
 x+f'{e}_{t}'[0,2] x+f'{e}_{t}'[1,2] x+f'{e}_{t}'[2,2] x+f'{e}_{t}'[3,2]
End
